        "description": "<p>Adds a button to the Gutenberg block sidebar (right) to toggle the editor sidebar to make it full-width.<br />\nAlso allows dragging the sidebar to a custom width.</p>\n<p>Particularly useful if you need more space to work with the additional block options or you use ACF to populate block options.</p>\n"
